{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2021-05-14 11:18:00', 'title': '7-Eleven, Inc. Completes Acquisition of 3,800 Speedway Stores', 'text': 'IRVING, TEXAS, MAY 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa07-ELEVEN, INC. ("7-ELEVEN"), THE LARGEST CHAIN IN THE CONVENIENCE-RETAILING INDUSTRY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE SUCCESSFUL COMPLETION OF ITS ACQUISITION OF SPEEDWAY, A LEADING CONVENIENCE STORE CHAIN, FROM MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. (NYSE: MPC). SPEEDWAY\'S HIGH-QUALITY PORTFOLIO INCLUDES APPROXIMATELY 3,800 STORES LOCATED IN 36 STATES ACROSS THE U.S. "WE ARE VERY EXCITED TO WELCOME SPEEDWAY INTO THE 7-ELEVEN FAMILY," SAID JOE DEPINTO, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF 7-ELEVEN.'}
